description: |
  Returns BIOC rules from the BIOC rules table, optionally filtered by type, name, or indicator. Use this action to review behavioral detection rules, audit BIOC coverage, or investigate which behavioral patterns are being monitored across the tenant. Results are paginated - to get a complete picture of all BIOC rules configured in the tenant, all pages need to be retrieved.
display: Cortex - List BIOC Rules
isdetailsoverridden: false
locked: false
